OL,3,GNEWSAPlans emerge for 525 homes and
OL,4,Acare facility
OL,5,
OL,6,FA housing developer has signalled its
OL,7,Fintent to build up to 525 homes and a
OL,8,Fcare facility of up to 80 beds on land
OL,9,Fnext to the A46.
OL,11,FParker Strategic Land has submitted
OL,12,Fdocuments to Leicester City Council
OL,13,Fasking whether an environmental impact
OL,14,Fassessment (EIA) is required as part of
OL,15,Fa planning application for a housing
OL,16,Fdevelopment on land south of
OL,17,FThurcaston.
OL,19,FAn EIA sets out the likely
OL,20,Fenvironmental impacts of a project and
OL,21,Fhow they can be mitigated.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
